            "name": "Secrets of Magic 2: Witches and Wizards",
            "steam_appid": 713430,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/713430/extras/6b4d78df639d6d77391a061f3e43305c.avif?t=1667217698\" width=600 height=270 /></span><br>After learning the fine art of magic and becoming a true witch, Victoria is ready to go after Agnes and set her parents free. Witches and wizards united in the fight against evil!<br>Dive into an exciting adventure by matching your way through a magical and dangerous land to defeat the ultimate evil. Grab your wand and prepare for battle in Secrets of Magic 2: Witches and Wizards.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Activate the most powerful amulet to break an evil spell</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Tons of unique and challenging levels</strong><br></li><li> <strong>4  game play modes: challenge, relaxed, expert, and casual</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Exciting match-3 gameplay</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Collect coins to boost your power-ups</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Plan your moves to get all three stars</strong></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Secrets of Magic: The Book of Spells</strong></h2>",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/713430/extras/6b4d78df639d6d77391a061f3e43305c.avif?t=1667217698\" width=600 height=270 /></span><br>After learning the fine art of magic and becoming a true witch, Victoria is ready to go after Agnes and set her parents free. Witches and wizards united in the fight against evil!<br>Dive into an exciting adventure by matching your way through a magical and dangerous land to defeat the ultimate evil. Grab your wand and prepare for battle in Secrets of Magic 2: Witches and Wizards.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Activate the most powerful amulet to break an evil spell</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Tons of unique and challenging levels</strong><br></li><li> <strong>4  game play modes: challenge, relaxed, expert, and casual</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Exciting match-3 gameplay</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Collect coins to boost your power-ups</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Plan your moves to get all three stars</strong></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Secrets of Magic: The Book of Spells</strong></h2>",
